# inc-5v47: selecting an unavailable Wild Shape must leave the druid alive.
# Real Wild Shape (src/Skills.cpp:5565) from a LOADED druid, so every seed
# starts from the same character. Run through tools/check_wildshape_gray.sh, or:
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#   INCURSION_LOAD=tools/fixtures/chars/druid-shoulder-metal-seed7-opt0822.sav \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/wildshape-gray.keys <seed>
# The fixture is already in wizard mode, so 'w' opens the wizard menu with no
# y/n question. Free Advancement + Cheat Death are the first and third switches.
# Druid 3 (three druid levels) is the Wild Shape threshold.
@dump:arrival
w
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
SPACE DOWN DOWN SPACE
ESC
w
@choose "Genocide Everything"
d
G
a
a
ESC
@dump:druid3
# Giant badger is SHADOW: HD 5 and Tiny are unavailable at Druid 3.
# Inspect the second Wild Shape page before selecting it.
u
@choose "Wild Shape"
TAB
@dump:gray-menu
@choose "giant badger"
@dump:post-pick
.
@dump:after-action
